.DS_Store

# Local test photos / scratch sheets (not redistributed)
test_images/

# The slicer port's Python control arm (`scripts/slicer_ref.py --out ref.json`, see CLAUDE.md). A
# generated artifact, ~1.2 MB, and it goes STALE the moment the slicer changes — committing it would
# invite `parity:slicer` being run against a reference that predates the code it is checking.
/ref.json

# Real reference scores / neyzen strips (copyrighted; not redistributed).
# The frozen Rung-3 exam list (testset.json — names/counts only, no copyrighted content) IS
# committed, which needs the negation chain below (git can't re-include inside an ignored DIR).
data/real/*
!data/real/rung3/
data/real/rung3/*
!data/real/rung3/testset.json

# The untouched VCSL drum recordings scripts/prepare_strokes.py downloads. A cache, not a source:
# re-running the script fetches them again, and what SHIPS is the prepared copy in
# apps/web/public/audio/ (which is committed, and is what /THIRD-PARTY.txt accounts for).
data/audio_src/

# F1's instrument voices, staged for upload by scripts/prepare_voices.py. ~56 MB of wav, and unlike
# the drums NOTHING here ever ships with the app: they are uploaded to a Hugging Face dataset repo
# and fetched at runtime through VITE_VOICES_URL. Committing them would put ~56 MB of binaries in a
# public repo permanently (owner decision, 2026-08-11), and this project already has files stuck in
# its history. Re-run the script to rebuild the folder.
data/audio_voices/

# Data and models (Ignore large files to prevent them from hitting GitHub limits)
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
data/synthetic/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.weights
*.h5

# Node / JS workspace
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/

# SymbTr-derived scores — NONE of these are redistributed (2026-08-08 copyright pass).
# SymbTr is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, so shipping any of them would bind this app to NonCommercial for good;
# two were also still-protected compositions under FSEK 5846 (life + 70). They stay on disk because
# `npm test`, `smoke:editor` and the manual checks read them through `?score=…`, and local use is
# not distribution — but nothing here may be committed or built into dist/. See docs/THIRD-PARTY.md.
apps/web/public/sample.json
apps/web/public/beyati-delisin.json
apps/web/public/gamzedeyim-deva.json
apps/web/public/safalar-getirdiniz.json
# Rung-2 batch-exported scores (SymbTr-derived; regenerate via scripts/export_scores.py)
apps/web/public/scores/
# A neyzen.com screenshot and its transcription — someone else's engraving, never redistributed.
# ⚠ Both were tracked until 2026-08-08; `git rm --cached` took them out of HEAD, but they are
# still in the repo's HISTORY. Removing them from there needs a rewrite (see docs/THIRD-PARTY.md).
/Meltem - 1. Hane.png
apps/web/public/meltem_notes.json

# NO IMAGE AT THE REPO ROOT IS COMMITTED. Structural, not a name list, because the next one will
# have a different name: a page to test with gets dropped here, `git add -A` sweeps it up, and the
# repo is PUBLIC. That is exactly how the neyzen.com screenshot above got into a history we now
# cannot clean without a force-push. Caught in the act on 2026-08-15 —
# bozukNihavendLonga.png, a printed engraving of Kevser Hanım's Nihavend Longa, sitting untracked
# at the root and one `git add -A` from being permanent.
# Real pages belong in data/real/ (ignored). The app's OWN artwork lives under apps/web/public/,
# which these three lines do not touch.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

# IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Rung-1.5 browser-gate assets (staged by src/vision/make_browser_gate.py; hundreds of MB)
apps/web/public/models/

data/checkpoints/
# Colab upload package (rebuild with scripts/make_colab_zip.sh)
data/colab/
# Stitched decode of a real page (stage-8 output; derived from data/real/)
apps/web/public/decoded.json
# W0 opencv.js parity fixtures: a corpus page + its raw grayscale, regenerated on demand by
# scripts/cv_probe_ref.py. Throwaway with the probe itself (plan W6).
apps/web/public/probe/

# Colab round-trip archives downloaded to the repo root (GB-scale; the unpacked
# result lives under data/real/, which is already ignored)
/*.zip

# W9 decode server (MVP): assembled model dir + bundle
apps/server/models/
apps/server/dist/

# ORT runtime copied in at build time by apps/web/tools/copy-ort.mjs
apps/web/public/ort/

# generated sol klarnet audit pages (tools/core/clarinet-chart.ts, clarinet-editor.ts)
# they inline a 460 KB photo, so they are rebuilt rather than committed
/out.html
/clarinet-chart.html
/clarinet-editor.html
/klarnet-duzenleyici.html
/klarnet-parmak-tablosu.html
